      {
        "evidence_id": "E003",
        "passage_id": "P002",
        "quote": "The plaintiff alleged that she was injured when she slipped and fell on a wet slippery substance that was on the floor of a restaurant operated by the defendant Carrabba's Italian Grill, LLC (hereinafter Carrabba's).",
