        "passage_id": "P001",
        "quote": "In an action to recover damages for personal injuries, etc., the plaintiffs appeal from an order of the Supreme Court, Kings County (Martin, J.), dated October 6, 2014, which granted the defendant's motion for summary judgment dismissing the complaint.",
